The classic [[frutiger-aero|Frutiger Aero]] =B=gel button=B=, made with two files and no pictures! The shine is a second gradient on top, and the glow is a box shadow.

Open `gel-button.html` in a browser to see it, or copy the CSS into your own page!

~~~ file: gel-button.html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Gel button</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="gel-button.css">
</head>
<body>
    <button class="gel">Click me!</button>
    <button class="gel gel-green">Go!</button>
</body>
</html>
~~~

~~~ file: gel-button.css
body {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 60px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #bfe6ff, #effaff);
    font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
}

/* the gel: a bright top half, a deeper bottom half, and a white shine */
.gel {
    --a: #7fd3ff;
    --b: #0a74c9;
    position: relative;
    padding: 12px 30px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 60, 120, 0.45);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 40, 90, 0.5);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--a) 0%, var(--b) 100%);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8), 0 4px 12px rgba(10, 116, 201, 0.35);
    cursor: pointer;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.gel::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 6%;
    right: 6%;
    top: 2px;
    height: 48%;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1));
    pointer-events: none;
}
.gel:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }
.gel:active { box-shadow: inset 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 40, 90, 0.45), 0 0 18px rgba(127, 211, 255, 0.9); }
.gel:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #ffb347; outline-offset: 3px; }
.gel-green { --a: #b6f08a; --b: #2e9a1c; }
~~~
